          "required": false,
          "allow_ai_generate": true,
          "description": "可选：若希望用独立画面做半透明浮影可单独提供；未单独提供时默认复用相邻段落画面作为双重曝光浮影。"
        }
      ],
      "transition_doc": "transitions/ghost-double-exposure/TRANSITION.md",
      "reference_doc": "transitions/ghost-double-exposure/references/jianying-and-ffmpeg-manual.md",
      "script": "transitions/ghost-double-exposure/scripts/apply_ghost_double_exposure.py"
